1.2 Value of infrastructure constructed/ rehabilitated (million EUR)
1.3 Number of persons trained in production practices and/or technologies (Core Indicator 1.1.4) 
1.4 Number of hectares of land brought under climate-resilient management (Core Indicator 3.1.4)
1.5  Number of products branded based on geographical origin

Outcome 2: Increased utilization of financial services among rural people in uplands
Indicators: Percentage decline in collateral coverage requested by participating financial institutions 
